    "Now just read a few short pieces the way you always do.\nTap “Done reading” when you finish each one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now just read a few short pieces the way you always do.\nTap “Done reading” when you finish each one."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "では、短い文章を数本いつも通りに読んでください。\n読み終えたら「読み終えました」を押してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이제 짧은 글 몇 편을 평소처럼 읽어 주세요.\n다 읽으면 '다 읽었어요'를 눌러 주세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在像平常一样读几段短文。\n每读完一段，点按“读完了”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
