    "Read a few short pieces the way you always do, and Nook will find the type size and spacing that suit your eyes — based on how you actually read.\nAbout five minutes, and quitting early still keeps what it learned.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read a few short pieces the way you always do, and Nook will find the type size and spacing that suit your eyes — based on how you actually read.\nAbout five minutes, and quitting early still keeps what it learned."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短い文章を数本いつも通りに読むだけで、Nook が読む速さをもとに目に合う文字サイズと間隔を見つけます。\n約5分。途中でやめても、それまでの結果は使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "짧은 글 몇 편을 평소처럼 읽기만 하면, Nook이 읽는 속도를 바탕으로 눈에 맞는 글자 크기와 간격을 찾아드려요.\n약 5분 걸리고, 언제든 그만둬도 그때까지의 결과를 쓸 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只需像平常一样读几段短文，Nook 就会根据你的实际阅读速度，找到适合你眼睛的字号和间距。\n大约五分钟，中途退出也会保留已学到的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read at your own pace": {
      "localizations": {
